      "sourceTextSha256": "6dcb8c0e2cdeac35fdf96752f0d4f7ab7f77520ae2957acac836eb939ca0e9b4",
      "text": "Upon arrival in Rio de Janeiro, your driver meets you at the airport for the transfer to your hotel. Rio has green hills, blue sky, beautiful bays, islands and marvellous beaches: Brazil’s second-largest city and one of the most beautiful in the world. Copacabana, Ipanema and Leblon are famous for their black-and-white mosaic promenades, and from early morning until late at night people play football and volleyball on the golden sand.\n\nFor those who enjoy an active holiday, Rio offers almost any sport, from golf, tennis and surfing to diving and hang-gliding; beach cafés serve refreshing coconut water and freshly squeezed juices, and local musicians often play on the beach.",
